; Game state: variables saved with the game (29 bytes)
;
; Saved by SAVE with $C11B, $CA84 and $BA8A. Roles inferred from the code that
; reads and writes each byte.
; .
; $B6EB-$B6ED: copy of the three bytes of the Bard command at $C9E2 (the script
; area is not saved); copied there at save ($84D2) and back at load ($848C).
; .
; Actor 0 is the player; $B6EA (before this block) is the actor now acting,
; $B6E7-$B6E9 verb and the two nouns.
@label=SavedScriptBytes
g$B6EB DEFB $00,$00,$00
@label=RandomEventPtr
 $B6EE DEFW $0000
@label=TimersFired
 $B6F0 DEFB $00
@label=ExitRestoreMode
 $B6F1 DEFB $00
@label=PrinterFlag
 $B6F2 DEFB $00
@label=ArrivalLocation
 $B6F3 DEFB $00
@label=ActorHasOrder
 $B6F4 DEFB $00
@label=PlayerLocation
 $B6F5 DEFB $00
@label=ActorLocation
 $B6F6 DEFB $00
@label=Score
 $B6F7 DEFW $0000
@label=ReplyGiven
 $B6F9 DEFB $00
@label=ActionPerform
 $B6FA DEFB $00
@label=ActionBlocked
 $B6FB DEFB $00
@label=TargetNamePtr
 $B6FC DEFW $0000
@label=Noun1Kind
 $B6FE DEFB $00
@label=Noun2Kind
 $B6FF DEFB $00
@label=LispFlag
 $B700 DEFB $00
@label=RawOutputFlag
 $B701 DEFB $00
@label=MessagesVisible
 $B702 DEFB $00
@label=PhraseMode
 $B703 DEFB $00
@label=OutputColumn
 $B704 DEFB $00
@label=ParserFlag
 $B705 DEFB $00
@label=ParserWordCount
 $B706 DEFB $FF
@label=PicturesEnabled
 $B707 DEFB $00
